    Bug 1924356 - Update hidden status of labels when setting total message count or folder size. r=aleca


    If enabled, this ensures total message count and folder size are displayed when new folder rows are added to Unread or Favorite modes, or when Compact View is toggled.

    Based on https://github.com/Betterbird/thunderbird-patches/blob/main/128/bugs/1924356-fix-total-count-display.patch

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D226220

